1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,316
Let's create three shapes to demonstrate removal animations.

2
00:00:04,466 --> 00:00:09,358
Uncreate is the reverse of Create, it un-draws the object.

3
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:13,230
FadeOut gradually makes the object transparent.

4
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:16,245
ShrinkToCenter shrinks the object to

5
00:00:16,345 --> 00:00:19,257
a point, opposite of GrowFromCenter.

